**Verdict:** The GIA 2.07ct F-VS1 at [$21,213](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/27103709?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) is the better natural choice. F color is above The Clarity Floor and the VS1 grade is safe. The 2.21ct G-VS2 offers more carat weight for slightly less money, but G-VS2 sits at both grade minimums with no margin.

