## Setting Styles for a 2 Carat Asscher Cut Diamond Ring

At 2ct, the setting choice affects the ring's visual balance more than at smaller sizes. A stone this size has real presence. The setting should frame it — not compete with it.

The wrong setting at 2ct shrinks the stone visually or fights the geometry. The right setting disappears behind the stone and lets the 7mm windmill do the work.

